{{!-- First-party page written for Volta (Qompass AI, 2026). --}}
{{#> layout }}
  <h2>{{ text "Statistics" }}</h2>

  <p>
    Volta exposes Prometheus metrics at <code>/metrics</code>, including
    request counts by route and key-upload counters, for operators who
    want to watch the health of the service.
  </p>

  <p>
    This public page intentionally keeps no per-address or per-key usage
    statistics: a keyserver's lookup traffic says a lot about who is
    talking to whom, and Volta does not publish it.
  </p>
{{/layout}}
